Command lists: Ocarina of Time parses the copy taken at submit, also after a semaphore wait and
for an entry resumed inside (GrowingBlackBeans' trust copy, viejunerd/Eglantine-PS5-#21).
EDEN_NX2_TRUST_COPY=0 turns it off, =1 turns it on for every title.

